WEBVTT


00:00:01.060 --> 00:00:03.700
Roller skating is the high definition of freedom

00:00:03.701 --> 00:00:06.560
It literally feels like you're floating

00:00:07.180 --> 00:00:09.180
I enjoy meeting new skaters

00:00:09.181 --> 00:00:10.720
It's beautiful to watch, like, 

00:00:10.740 --> 00:00:15.680
people coming together just because they invested into roller skate

00:00:16.178 --> 00:00:17.980
When you're in a room full of skaters,

00:00:17.981 --> 00:00:21.999
It's like we're on a certain type of frequency and a certain type of sync 

00:00:23.060 --> 00:00:26.840
Hopefully we can have a space that's designated for roller skaters,

00:00:26.940 --> 00:00:29.254
and that's how the culture is gonna be able to survive 

00:00:29.255 --> 00:00:32.517
and get bigger, because roller skating is actually really good 

00:00:32.518 --> 00:00:35.080
for the community and people around the community
